---
import type { Locale } from "../data/lang";
import { cmds } from "../data/site";
interface Props { locale: Locale }
const zh = Astro.props.locale === "zh";
const rows = zh ? [
  ["Sony / Android TV", "默认桌面与实体 Home"],
  ["Google TV", "默认 HOME 解析、原厂桌面是否重新打开"],
  ["小米 / Redmi", "Home 失败才查固件包名筛选；唤醒失败另查待机清理与后台启动"],
  ["TCL / 雷鸟", "先区分 APK 安装校验与 HOME 声明限制，再查守护和自启动"],
  ["海信 Android / 创维酷开", "按固件检查 Home、后台启动和守护服务绑定"],
  ["LG webOS", "独立 IPK 预览、Developer Mode 与 SSH；不使用 ADB，尚无 Home Helper"],
] : [
  ["Sony / Android TV", "Default launcher and physical Home key"],
  ["Google TV", "HOME resolution and whether stock Home returns"],
  ["Xiaomi / Redmi", "Investigate firmware package filtering only after Home fails; wake failures need separate background checks"],
  ["TCL / FFalcon", "Separate APK verification and HOME declaration restrictions from guard/autostart"],
  ["Hisense Android / Skyworth", "Firmware-specific Home, background launch and guard binding"],
  ["LG webOS", "Separate IPK preview, Developer Mode and SSH; no ADB or shipped Home Helper"],
];
---
<div class="installation-checks">
  <h3>{zh ? "两种手动安装方式，同一套验收标准" : "Two manual routes, one verification standard"}</h3>
  <p>{zh ? "A · 遥控器 / U 盘：下载正确 APK，安装并打开，按电视提供的默认桌面选择器设置。从其他应用按实体 Home 测试。仍回原桌面时，Tigris 仍可作为应用打开；完整接管可能需要 ADB 或专用适配。U 盘不会自动授予系统权限。" : "A · Remote / USB: install the correct APK, open it, and use the TV’s default-home picker if available. Test physical Home from another app. If stock Home returns, Tigris still works as an app; takeover may require ADB or firmware adaptation. USB installation grants no special system permissions."}</p>
  <p>{zh ? "B · 电脑：按下面步骤安装后运行统一检查器。AI 安装使用同一检查器。检查会打开系统设置并发送 Home；安装、实体 Home、待机唤醒、重启分别报告，没测过就写未验证。" : "B · Computer: after installation, run the shared checker below. AI installation uses the same checker. Verification opens Settings and sends HOME. Report installation, physical Home, wake and reboot separately; mark anything untested as unverified."}</p>
  <div class="code"><pre><code id="cmd-shared-check" data-cmd={JSON.stringify(cmds.checkHome)}>{cmds.checkHome.powershell}</code></pre><button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="#cmd-shared-check"><span class="label"></span></button></div>
  <p>{zh ? "先安装、再验证；失败才处理具体固件限制。Success、默认 HOME 解析或守护已启用，都不能代替实体 Home 验证。保留所有品牌的原厂桌面。" : "Install, verify, then investigate firmware restrictions only when needed. Success, HOME resolution or an enabled guard cannot replace a physical Home test. Keep stock launchers enabled on every brand."}</p>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table><caption>{zh ? "按电视品牌排查" : "Troubleshoot by platform and brand"}</caption><tbody>{rows.map(row => <tr><th scope="row">{row[0]}</th><td>{row[1]}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
  <p><a href="https://github.com/lesnolie/Tigris/blob/main/docs/installation-compatibility.md">{zh ? "完整规则、检查结果与安全回退" : "Full rules, evidence and recovery"} ↗</a></p>
</div>
<style>.installation-checks{margin:32px 0;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--line, #364354);border-radius:20px}.installation-checks h3{font-size:24px}.installation-checks p{margin:16px 0;line-height:1.7}</style>
